services:
Deploy offers professional business advisory and brokerage services for small and lower middle-market businesses in the Carolinas region based in North Myrtle Beach. Specialty areas include an emphasis on consultative business and exit planning advisory preceding and leading up to the packaging and marketing phase of the project. As a Master Certified Business Intermediary (MCBI) affiliate with the IBBA, the Company is uniquely qualified to provide an objective and in-depth understanding in the following areas in preparation for full transactional and closing support: 

>Preliminary exit planning consulting for dynamic markets; 
>Business growth and life cycle stages; 
>Financial performance analysis and trends; 
>Business pricing methodology and value ranges; 
>Factors influencing SWOT, maximum transaction values, and the overall story of the enterprise; 
>Expected deal timeframes; 
>Regional market and industry trends by sector; 
>The intersection of price and enterprise value in the marketplace;
>Fully integrated commercial real estate support;
>Full access to the IBBA network, databases, and professional affiliates.

A customized, personal approach through a broad network of multi-talented professionals assures clients maximum results from proven advisors. The Company is uniquely positioned to facilitate transactions including both business and commercial real estate components, with financing packages prepared and submitted through *Preferred SBA Lending* alliances in the IBBA network.

