introduction:
We assist small business owners in the confidential sale of their business and/or growth through franchising. I am a Certified Business Intermediary (CBI), a Certified Public Accountant (CPA), and licensed real estate sales agent. We help entrepreneurs realize their dreams of working for themselves by buying existing businesses or franchises. 

Letting TBA manage the entire sale process adds several value features for the seller, including:

- Confidentially marketing the business sale throughout Transworld’s extensive network;
- Providing the seller with current updates on the progress of the sale;
- Managing the due diligence process for the seller; 
- Preparing a comprehensive business analysis;
- Assisting with the business valuation process;
- Meeting with and qualifying potential buyers; 
- Assisting in the preparation of the offer;
- Coordinating the closing of the sale. 

With a proven track record of over 40 years, Transworld Business Advisors has over 200 offices in the US, with over 500 business agents and over $1.4 Billion in listings at any given time. In addition, Transworld provides the following unique benefits to both the seller and the purchaser:

- Utmost professionalism and confidentiality;
- More money gets spent by TBA on advertising the sale of your business;
- TBA makes use of multi-media advertising, including radio, television, and internet sites;
- TBA makes effective use of media exposure through journal articles, podcasts, and other social media outlets;
- TBA makes use of proprietary and proven internet marketing protocols;
- TBA owners & agents receive the finest quality training in the industry;
- TBA owners & agents are backed by a high-tier support team with countless years of applicable experience;
- TBA's Sales Process has been utilized to consummate thousands of business sales transactions;
- TBA franchisees maintain attractive offices to conduct confidential meetings with sellers and buyers

Since our inception, we have excelled in getting deals done! Call us and you will understand what makes us the best company to handle any business sale--our proven motto is "good deals for good people."

