introduction:
I am an award-winning, driven, and highly motivated professional with more than 20 years of experience in the sale, investment, development and property management of commercial and residential real estate. I have a strong entrepreneurial drive and focus on the bottom-line while being ever mindful of providing stellar service to clients.

Gaining early business experience with UPS, the global leader in logistics, packaging and specialized transportation, I made significant contributions as a “change agent” improving efficiencies, reducing costs, and driving quality.

With an entrepreneurial spirit and record of success in the real estate marketplace, my expertise lies in building strong client relationships, ensuring quality service, and negotiating the best terms possible to close transactions. These unique skill sets have enabled me to become a top performer in marketing commercial real estate and a leader in the sale of office, retail and industrial space. As such, my colleagues refer to me as “The Bulldog” and “Mr. Networker.”

I am an active member of numerous real estate associations, a CCIM Candidate, and elected President of the St. Charles Real Estate Association in St. Charles, MO in 2013.

AFFILIATIONS:
The CCIM Institute of the National Association of REALTORS®: CCIM Candidate;
International Council of Shopping Centers: Member;
Saint Louis Association of Realtors: Board Member;
Missouri Association of Commercial Realtors: Committee Member;
National Association of Realtors: Member;
St. Charles Association of Realtors: President-elect; Board of Directors; Congressional Awareness Committee Member

Company Information:

The BAF Group is a professionally oriented business brokerage, heavily involved in transactions in the MARYLAND, VIRGINIA, PENNSYLVANIA, DELAWARE and WASHINGTON (DC) markets.  Don Barrick (Principal) has been involved in business acquisitions, start-ups and divestitures, as well as site selections and trouble-shooting for more than twenty-five years.

Specialization:

Our programs are geared toward assisting Sellers with pricing, promoting, positioning and bringing your business to a successful settlement, with a maximum of efficiency.  Buyers can be assured that similar care is taken to provide you with quality-oriented opportunities.  You will receive any and all documentation and cooperation you will require to make an intelligent, informed decision about the businesses we represent.  And there is normally NO UP-FRONT COST associated with our service!

We have the ability to work with Buyers, to obtain funding for any number of acquisitions.  Our network includes SBA lenders, private Investors, commercial Banks, Venture Capitalists and "Angel Investors".

The BAF Group also works with a variety of qualified, experienced professionals to whom Sellers and Buyers may (upon request) be referred.  These include, but are not limited to:

*  Contract attorneys;
*  Accountants;
*  Loan processors, including SBA representatives;
*  Insurance specialists;
*  Immigration attorneys;
*  And more!

More than 75% of our listings and buyer-leads are a result of referrals from past buyers and sellers.  We work very hard to prove our value to you, with every transaction; the relationships we have with past clients demonstrates our record of success!

Call us for a casual introduction, today.

services:
We can assist Sellers and Buyers in turn, with:
*  Broker's Price Opinions;
*  Positioning the Business for sale;
*  Aggressively promoting the sale, but usually in extreme confidence;
*  Qualifying Buyers;
*  Negotiating a satisfactory price;
*  Consulting on appropriate terms;
*  Assisting the Buyer with loan options;
*  Bringing the transaction to a satisfactory close!

 We see the entire deal through, from soup to nuts.
